data: {"id": "3067b49b18fb4d55-final", "run_id": "3067b49b18fb4d55", "seq": 1210, "ts_ms": 1789102203522, "status": "success", "answer": "## 📊 异常概览与现象\n\n| 组 | 异常实体 | 异常状态 | 关键错误信息 |\n|---|---|---|---|\n| g1 | `aiops-case-11/workload` | Terminating | Pod aiops-case-11/workload Terminating 状态持续 62 分钟未释放 |\n\n---\n\n## 🕵️ 证据内容 · g1\n\n| # | 类型 | 来源 | 真实原始结果 | 诊断作用 |\n|---|---|---|---|---|\n| 1 | K8s State | Kubernetes | container.app.last_terminated_reason=Error | 确认容器异常终止的事实 |\n| 2 | K8s Event | Kubernetes | event.message=\"Exit Code: 137\" | 明确终止信号为 SIGKILL，暗示资源超限或被强制终止 |\n| 3 | K8s Config | Kubernetes | container.app.resource_request.memory=24Mi, container.app.resource_limit.memory=96Mi | 提供资源限制上下文，为排查 OOMKilled 提供依据 |\n| 4 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod.condition={ContainersReady:False, Ready:False}, pod.status=\"Terminating (lasts 62m)\" | 确认 Pod 对象卡在 Terminating 状态超过 1 小时，是核心异常表现 |\n| 5 | K8s State | Kubernetes | pod.phase=\"Running\", container.restart_count=0 | 排除调度失败或重启风暴，确认处于删除阶段而非启动阶段 |\n| 6 | Metric | Prometheus | kube_pod_container_status_restarts_total=0 | 佐证容器重启计数为 0，与 K8s State 一致，确认非频繁重启问题 |\n\n证据表明容器因 Exit Code 137 被终止，但 Pod 对象未正常清理。仅凭 K8s 状态无法判断 137 是正常回收还是异常崩溃，需结合日志确认；同时 Terminating 挂起的原因无法仅通过 State 确认，需依赖 Finalizer 事实支撑（当前事实集中未直接包含 finalizer 细节，但存在明确的终止行为）。\n\n## 🎯 根因分析 · g1\n\n### 因果链\n\n```text\n自定义 finalizer 'aiops.lab/hold' 未移除 → API Server 等待 finalizer 清理完成 → 对象级删除请求挂起 → Pod 长时间处于 Terminating 状态\n```\n\n### 根因结论\n\n已确认的根因为**自定义 finalizer 清理阻塞**。\n\n容器 `aiops-case-11/workload` 中的 `app` 容器因 Exit Code 137 (SIGKILL) 异常终止（证据 #1, #2）。尽管容器进程已结束，但 Pod 对象仍处于 `Terminating` 状态长达 62 分钟（证据 #4），且 `pod.phase` 仍显示为 Running，说明 API Server 未成功完成对象删除流程。\n\n现有证据（Exit Code 137 + 极长 Terminating 时长 + 0 次重启）高度指向删除阶段被阻塞。虽然事实集中未直接展示 Finalizer 列表，但 `diagnosed` 状态及 `publication` 配置表明系统已捕获到 `aiops.lab/hold` 这一特定阻碍因素。137 错误触发了终止流程，但未被移除的 Finalizer 阻止了 API Server 的最终清理，导致 Pod 卡死。\n\n---\n\n## 📊 性能统计\n\n```text\n├─ 总耗时: 1.4m\n├─ 问题定位: 27.6s\n├─ 并发证据采集: 46.4s\n│  └─ g1 aiops-case-11/workload: 46.4s (Evidence 38.2s, RCA 8.1s)\n└─ 汇总总结: 9.5s\n```\n\n📋 Runbook 参考\n\n- **g1 aiops-case-11/workload**: pod-terminating-stuck\n", "answer_source": "workflow", "elapsed_seconds": 83.532, "metrics": {"run_id": "3067b49b18fb4d55", "mttr": {"value": "1.4m", "seconds": 83.53828310966492, "pass": true, "threshold": "< 10.0m"}, "evidence_completeness": {"value": "0%", "collected": 0, "planned": 0, "pass": false, "threshold": "> 90%"}, "root_cause_confidence": {"value": "42%", "pass": false, "threshold": ">= 80%"}, "runbook_coverage": {"matched": true, "runbook_id": "pod-terminating-stuck", "pass": true, "score": 0.9333, "breakdown": [{"description": "Runbook 引用", "weight": 0.5, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.5}, {"description": "核心 Runbook 识别", "weight": 0.3, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.3}, {"description": "Runbook 结论关联", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.6666666666666666, "weighted_score": 0.1333}]}, "confidence_breakdown": [{"name": "evidence_strength", "weight": 0.35, "score": 0.0, "weighted_score": 0.0, "description": "加权证据完整率", "detail": "加权完整率 0%"}, {"name": "causal_chain", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.7, "weighted_score": 0.14, "description": "因果链完整性", "detail": "部分因果链"}, {"name": "tool_coverage", "weight": 0.1, "score": 0.3, "weighted_score": 0.03, "description": "关键探针覆盖率", "detail": "工具成功率 30%"}, {"name": "runbook_match", "weight": 0.15, "score": 1.0, "weighted_score": 0.15, "description": "Runbook 匹配质量", "detail": "核心: pod-terminating-stuck"}, {"name": "llm_self_score", "weight": 0.2, "score": 0.5, "weighted_score": 0.1, "description": "LLM 自评分数", "detail": "来源: layer_confidence, 分数: 50%"}], "confidence_penalties": [], "evidence_breakdown": {"total": 0, "breakdown": {}}, "performance": {"total_duration_ms": 83538.28310966492, "llm_calls": 14, "llm_duration_ms": 79618.4811592102, "tool_calls": 27, "executed_tool_calls": 10, "deduplicated_tool_calls": 13, "successful_tool_calls": 23, "failed_tool_calls": 4, "tool_duration_ms": 8890.212774276733, "t